      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow3:061",
        "answer": "Constructs CoD.DirectorCustomGameButtonCountdown from the displayed menu/controller/layout arguments. Creates timer as LUI.UIText.new, Spacer as CoD.VerticalListSpacer.new, CountdownText as LUI.UIText.new. Connects 2 model/path references; the model subscription effects below specify which receiver changes and under which nil/value guard. Installs 1 event/action/override bindings; each callback keeps its captured controller/menu/widget references and executes only on its bound delivery. The ordered effect contract retains every property, model, visual, navigation, callback and return mutation in source order; returning self is not proof the original game loads this widget.",
